  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;be a vector&nbsp;such that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to _______."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "29",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>And&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>,</p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>On comparing we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;.....(i)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;............(ii)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;........(iii)</p><p>On solving equation (i), (ii) and (iii) we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>29</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>29</mn></math></p><p>Note: This question appeared&nbsp;in JEE Main 2022, 29th june shift 2. The question was incorrect, so it is&nbsp;modified to make it correct.</p>"
  }
